        "type": "function",
        "z": "eb7cf4139be428d0",
        "g": "4c4e09851b28c5bb",
        "name": "Corriente promedio",
        "func": "let arraycsv = msg.payload;\nlet nmro_registros = arraycsv.length;\n\nmsg.index = nmro_registros;\n\nflow.set(\"corriente_promedio\", arraycsv[0].corriente);\nlet corrientePromedio = flow.get(\"corriente_promedio\");\n\nfor (let i = 0; i < nmro_registros; i++) {\n    let corrienteActual = arraycsv[i].corriente\n    if (corrientePromedio){\n        corrientePromedio += corrienteActual;\n    }\n    flow.set(\"corriente_promedio\", (corrientePromedio/nmro_registros).toFixed(2));\n}\n\nmsg.payload = flow.get(\"corriente_promedio\");\nreturn msg;",
